<title>USA: Fisher Scientific says has Trinity I offer.</title>
<headline>Fisher Scientific says has Trinity I offer.</headline>
<dateline>HAMPTON, N.H. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fisher Scientific International Inc said on Thursday that investment group Trinity I Fund LP had made an unsolicited proposal involving an acquisition of the company.</p>
<p>The amount of the bid was not disclosed. Fisher said its directors and financial advisors would review the offer, but that the company would have no further comment until the evaluation process was complete.</p>
<p>Fisher provides healthcare, industrial and educational products and services.</p>
